{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/898ea5270d09684aeac1a7c0c25e6a5b.avif?t=1765810292\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo is a snippet of a bigger project I'm working on.\u00a0Make sure to <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0<strong>The Game</strong> so you don\u2019t miss the full release!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Heather, a young woman working the late shift at a quiet diner near Coker Creek, Tennessee.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But tonight isn\u2019t just another slow night. A brutal murder has taken place in the woods nearby\u2014matching the pattern of an infamous killer the authorities have been chasing for years. Locals call him the <strong><i>Ghost Ripper</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d676efa304493408dc5e7efad336a2f2.poster.avif?t=1765810292\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d676efa304493408dc5e7efad336a2f2.webm?t=1765810292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d6741c1cc1f47ef73fc0246d10da86db.avif?t=1765810292\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ghost Ripper</strong>, you play as Heather, a diner waitress abducted during her night shift and held captive in an abandoned asylum haunted by a brutal killer known as \u201cThe Ghost Ripper.\u201d Explore the  remnants of the abandoned asylum, uncover the killer\u2019s dark past, and solve environmental puzzles to make it out alive \u2014 but beware, he is always watching.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong> Uncover the dark backstory of the killer through audiotapes and scattered notes hidden throughout the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, PS1/PS2-inspired visual style, with low-poly graphics and eerie atmospheric effects that pay homage to classic survival horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/bf32cfd20c3640b455099c43b8a4127d.poster.avif?t=1765810292\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/bf32cfd20c3640b455099c43b8a4127d.webm?t=1765810292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A tense atmosphere, intense chases, and an ever-present sense of danger will keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-Oriented Gameplay:</strong> Use stealth to avoid the killer \u2014don't make a noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Puzzles:</strong> Solve environment-based puzzles to progress through the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror:</strong> Manage limited resources, avoid the killer, and survive his deadly chase.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the night, or will you become the next victim of the Ghost Ripper?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d207c7e7d5f4a10348774bc5af617439.avif?t=1765810292\" width=750 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to join the Third Eye Studio's Discord server to keep up with the latest updates and have a good time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Feel free to use art\u00a0from our\u00a0PressKit\u00a0for your thumbnails or posts here!</strong></i><br><strong><i>impress.games/press-kit/third-eye-studios/ghost-ripper</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694230?t=1765810292","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694230?t=1765810292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/7a6cae077cb40f9436298fdcf6358a0bf53e5e1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765810292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/7a6cae077cb40f9436298fdcf6358a0bf53e5e1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765810292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains graphic violence, disturbing imagery, and psychological horror. Some scenes may also feature flashing lights or photosensitive content. Viewer discretion is advised."},"demos":[{"appid":3796920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/898ea5270d09684aeac1a7c0c25e6a5b.avif?t=1765810292\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo is a snippet of a bigger project I'm working on.\u00a0Make sure to <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0<strong>The Game</strong> so you don\u2019t miss the full release!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Heather, a young woman working the late shift at a quiet diner near Coker Creek, Tennessee.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But tonight isn\u2019t just another slow night. A brutal murder has taken place in the woods nearby\u2014matching the pattern of an infamous killer the authorities have been chasing for years. Locals call him the <strong><i>Ghost Ripper</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d676efa304493408dc5e7efad336a2f2.poster.avif?t=1765810292\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d676efa304493408dc5e7efad336a2f2.webm?t=1765810292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d6741c1cc1f47ef73fc0246d10da86db.avif?t=1765810292\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ghost Ripper</strong>, you play as Heather, a diner waitress abducted during her night shift and held captive in an abandoned asylum haunted by a brutal killer known as \u201cThe Ghost Ripper.\u201d Explore the  remnants of the abandoned asylum, uncover the killer\u2019s dark past, and solve environmental puzzles to make it out alive \u2014 but beware, he is always watching.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong> Uncover the dark backstory of the killer through audiotapes and scattered notes hidden throughout the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, PS1/PS2-inspired visual style, with low-poly graphics and eerie atmospheric effects that pay homage to classic survival horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/bf32cfd20c3640b455099c43b8a4127d.poster.avif?t=1765810292\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/bf32cfd20c3640b455099c43b8a4127d.webm?t=1765810292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A tense atmosphere, intense chases, and an ever-present sense of danger will keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-Oriented Gameplay:</strong> Use stealth to avoid the killer \u2014don't make a noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Puzzles:</strong> Solve environment-based puzzles to progress through the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror:</strong> Manage limited resources, avoid the killer, and survive his deadly chase.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the night, or will you become the next victim of the Ghost Ripper?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d207c7e7d5f4a10348774bc5af617439.avif?t=1765810292\" width=750 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to join the Third Eye Studio's Discord server to keep up with the latest updates and have a good time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Feel free to use art\u00a0from our\u00a0PressKit\u00a0for your thumbnails or posts here!</strong></i><br><strong><i>impress.games/press-kit/third-eye-studios/ghost-ripper</i></strong></p>","developers":["Third Eye Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/bd6848387e3e2b64e0ae13fea71ec75d669cd64a/header.jpg?t=1765810292","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3694230/774471337/205ff31fe90685511ee4bf994dd0ec36e73d0bbe/1750461702/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750501064","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3694230/774471337/205ff31fe90685511ee4bf994dd0ec36e73d0bbe/1750461702/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750501064","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3694230/774471337/205ff31fe90685511ee4bf994dd0ec36e73d0bbe/1750461702/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750501064","id":257159483,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159483/8f0594d15fc1a8d764de23409b729c3ac12a01d9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750501064"}],"name":"Ghost Ripper","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stron